            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Corps and the Overseas Exchange Teacher Program. The teacher may request an extension of the original leave for up to one (1) additional school year. Before a teacher is granted detached service leave, he must present evidence of an offer of employment for one (1) of the accepting agencies. Application for detached service in the next school year shall be made by April 15.",
