        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. Temporary duty leave may be initiated by the teacher or the Board. If initiated by the Board, the Board shall bear all expenses as provided by Florida Statutes.",
            "block_bbox": [
                90,
                296,
